      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 4.08,
          "en": "So here's this project from the last lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.08,
          "end": 6.51,
          "en": "up and running in my browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.51,
          "end": 10.47,
          "en": "And on first site, it all looks great, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.47,
          "end": 13.47,
          "en": "If I open my browser's developer tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.47,
          "end": 18.47,
          "en": "I got no errors here in the console and it all seems to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.6,
          "end": 23.6,
          "en": "until I accidentally or on purpose enter a duration of zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.57,
          "end": 27.21,
          "en": "or a negative duration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.21,
          "end": 30.63,
          "en": "At that point, everything seems to crash",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.63,
          "end": 33.603,
          "en": "and we're left with a blank screen pretty much.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.59,
          "end": 37.47,
          "en": "And now if we open the developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.47,
          "end": 41.34,
          "en": "we are also greeted by an error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.34,
          "end": 44.37,
          "en": "Now, of course, if you did go through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.37,
          "end": 47.73,
          "en": "that essentials practice course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.73,
          "end": 52.73,
          "en": "this is an error we also got and fixed in that section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 53.43,
          "end": 55.819,
          "en": "But there I just told you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.819,
          "end": 59.43,
          "en": "what the problem and the solution was",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 59.43,
          "end": 63.51,
          "en": "and I did not really explain how you could find the reason",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 63.51,
          "end": 66.06,
          "en": "for this error message on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 66.06,
          "end": 70.14,
          "en": "And that's, therefore, exactly what we're going to do now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.14,
          "end": 75.03,
          "en": "Because when facing an error and an error message like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 75.03,
          "end": 77.7,
          "en": "you can quickly feel overwhelmed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.7,
          "end": 79.74,
          "en": "After all, there is a lot of text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.74,
          "end": 82.74,
          "en": "and a lot of red on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.74,
          "end": 85.92,
          "en": "But you should not feel overwhelmed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.92,
          "end": 89.03999999999999,
          "en": "because most react error messages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.03999999999999,
          "end": 92.793,
          "en": "are actually quite helpful and insightful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 93.69,
          "end": 96.81,
          "en": "And it all starts with the main message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.81,
          "end": 100.28999999999999,
          "en": "which always comes relatively early",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.28999999999999,
          "end": 103.62,
          "en": "in that block of red text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.62,
          "end": 106.47,
          "en": "We can see that it's an uncalled type error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 106.47,
          "end": 109.59,
          "en": "and that might not be too useful,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 109.59,
          "end": 112.92,
          "en": "but then we can see that the problem seems to be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 112.92,
          "end": 115.41,
          "en": "that the browser in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 115.41,
          "end": 118.11,
          "en": "which tries to execute this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 118.11,
          "end": 122.993,
          "en": "fails to read some properties of an undefined value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 124.02,
          "end": 125.55,
          "en": "To be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.55,
          "end": 130.55,
          "en": "it failed to read the valueEndOfYear property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 133.17,
          "en": "It failed to access this property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.17,
          "end": 135.96,
          "en": "and the value stored in that property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.96,
          "end": 140.22,
          "en": "because the object on which it tried to access this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 140.22,
          "end": 142.53,
          "en": "seemed to be undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.53,
          "end": 146.73,
          "en": "That's what this error message in the end tells us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.73,
          "end": 148.98,
          "en": "And this already gives us a good idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 148.98,
          "end": 153.24,
          "en": "of where in our code we might start our search",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 153.24,
          "end": 155.67000000000002,
          "en": "for the error reason.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.67000000000002,
          "end": 158.13,
          "en": "We should, of course, start in the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.13,
          "end": 163.13,
          "en": "where we do try to access the valueEndOfYear property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 166.62,
          "en": "And in this application and in this code base",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 166.62,
          "end": 169.41,
          "en": "that's in the Results JSX file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.41,
          "end": 172.29,
          "en": "And there, for example, it's this line of code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.29,
          "end": 174.723,
          "en": "where we try to access this property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 176.19,
          "end": 179.13,
          "en": "But we actually don't even have to look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 179.13,
          "end": 182.28,
          "en": "for the usage of this property manually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 182.28,
          "end": 186.45,
          "en": "Instead, in this error message, after the actual message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 186.45,
          "end": 189.57,
          "en": "we got the so-called stack trace,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 189.57,
          "end": 194.49,
          "en": "which is simply this output here below the error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 194.49,
          "end": 197.67000000000002,
          "en": "This is simply a list of code executions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 197.67000000000002,
          "end": 199.89,
          "en": "that led to this error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 199.89,
          "end": 201.15,
          "en": "And here we, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 201.15,
          "end": 204.753,
          "en": "see that the error is coming from the results function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 206.31,
          "end": 208.983,
          "en": "So from the results component function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 210.32999999999998,
          "end": 214.44,
          "en": "And there, from line eight, that's what this means.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.44,
          "end": 217.65,
          "en": "The 16 then refers to the column,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.65,
          "end": 220.77,
          "en": "so the 16th character you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.77,
          "end": 223.683,
          "en": "but it's typically the line number that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.76,
          "end": 226.62,
          "en": "And this, of course, allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.62,
          "end": 228.69,
          "en": "to go to this results function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 228.69,
          "end": 230.52,
          "en": "and take a look at line eight.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 234.12,
          "en": "And of course, that's the same line I identified before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.12,
          "end": 238.26,
          "en": "but we wouldn't even have to look for this property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.26,
          "end": 241.2,
          "en": "because we could have just followed this trace here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 241.2,
          "end": 244.353,
          "en": "and go directly to that file and the deadline number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 245.76,
          "end": 247.53,
          "en": "So now we know that the error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 247.53,
          "end": 250.5,
          "en": "is coming from this line of code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 250.5,
          "end": 253.59,
          "en": "Now, this line of code is correct though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 253.59,
          "end": 257.25,
          "en": "but if you recall, the error message also was",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 257.25,
          "end": 261.45,
          "en": "that the problem is that we fail to read this property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 261.45,
          "end": 264.09,
          "en": "on an undefined value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 264.09,
          "end": 267.93,
          "en": "So the actual problem is that in this line of code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 267.93,
          "end": 271.02,
          "en": "this year seems to be undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 271.02,
          "end": 276.02,
          "en": "Results zero seems to yield an undefined value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 276.57,
          "end": 278.46,
          "en": "and therefore, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 278.46,
          "end": 283.293,
          "en": "we have to go to the place where results is populated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 284.4,
          "end": 287.82,
          "en": "Now, compared to the practice course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 287.82,
          "end": 290.90999999999997,
          "en": "I slightly altered this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 290.90999999999997,
          "end": 294.48,
          "en": "and the results array is now an array that's created here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.48,
          "end": 296.64,
          "en": "and that's then passed as an argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 296.64,
          "end": 299.43,
          "en": "to calculate investment results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 299.43,
          "end": 300.93,
          "en": "And in that function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 300.93,
          "end": 302.85,
          "en": "it's received as an input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 302.85,
          "end": 307.14,
          "en": "and then manipulated from inside this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 307.14,
          "end": 310.08,
          "en": "And I'll get back to why I switched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 310.08,
          "end": 314.34,
          "en": "to this way of handling results later in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 314.34,
          "end": 316.17,
          "en": "But what's important here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 316.17,
          "end": 320.312,
          "en": "is that this results array is initially empty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 320.312,
          "end": 322.14,
          "en": "and therefore, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 322.14,
          "end": 326.463,
          "en": "trying to access the first element on that array would fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 327.51,
          "end": 329.43,
          "en": "So the problem seems to be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 329.43,
          "end": 333.99,
          "en": "that inside of this calculateInvestmentResults function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 333.99,
          "end": 337.743,
          "en": "the results array doesn't seem to get populated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 339.12,
          "end": 341.34000000000003,
          "en": "Now, if we go to this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 341.34000000000003,
          "end": 346.02,
          "en": "we can see that this results array does, in theory,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 346.02,
          "end": 348.36,
          "en": "receive new elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 348.36,
          "end": 351.603,
          "en": "but that happens inside of this for loop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 352.74,
          "end": 354.63,
          "en": "So since our problem seems to be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 354.63,
          "end": 357.36,
          "en": "that the first element is undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 357.36,
          "end": 360.36,
          "en": "so that there is no first element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 360.36,
          "end": 361.83,
          "en": "the problem seems to be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 361.83,
          "end": 365.013,
          "en": "that this for loop here never executes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 366.27,
          "end": 367.44,
          "en": "So therefore, let's take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 367.44,
          "end": 370.683,
          "en": "at how this for loop is configured, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 371.67,
          "end": 373.95,
          "en": "And here we can see that in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 373.95,
          "end": 378.693,
          "en": "we are looping as long as I is smaller than duration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 379.86,
          "end": 382.23,
          "en": "So if this code doesn't get executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 382.23,
          "end": 384.9,
          "en": "that can really only be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 384.9,
          "end": 387.39,
          "en": "if duration is smaller than I,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 387.39,
          "end": 389.37,
          "en": "if it's not greater than I,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 389.37,
          "end": 392.64300000000003,
          "en": "because that's our condition that it is greater than I.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 393.51,
          "end": 395.85,
          "en": "So it seems to be smaller than I.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 395.85,
          "end": 399.87,
          "en": "And, of course, that's the case if in this app here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 399.87,
          "end": 403.74,
          "en": "we enter a duration of zero or minus one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 403.74,
          "end": 405.093,
          "en": "or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 406.65,
          "end": 409.05,
          "en": "So therefore now we narrowed down the problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 409.05,
          "end": 411.51,
          "en": "and we understand that the problem is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 411.51,
          "end": 413.82,
          "en": "that if this code doesn't execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 413.82,
          "end": 416.55,
          "en": "due to a negative duration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 416.55,
          "end": 421.23,
          "en": "this code here will fail because there is no first element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 421.23,
          "end": 423.93,
          "en": "So therefore, to fix this problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 423.93,
          "end": 425.92,
          "en": "we could add a if check here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 426.81,
          "end": 431.81,
          "en": "and check if results length is equal to zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 431.88,
          "end": 434.1,
          "en": "so if we have no elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 434.1,
          "end": 437.28,
          "en": "And in that case we could return a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 437.28,
          "end": 442.28,
          "en": "where we maybe say Invalid input data provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 443.22,
          "end": 444.753,
          "en": "or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 446.01,
          "end": 447.6,
          "en": "Since I'm returning here,",
          "zh": ""
